{"2921640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EMITIME", "steam_appid": 2921640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMITIME is a RHYTHM-based DECKBUILDER - where MUSIC is your STRATEGY!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combing multiple genres together, EMITIME creates a stylish and unique gameplay that makes you bop to the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your Attack and Movement to the RHYTHM on the Grid, and activate your SKILL CARDS to defeat the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck and customize your characters with frequencies (power ups!) during each run with various possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters from the Past... and Future...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the characters from the Past, or the Future - each of them is equipped with the power of &quot;EMITIME&quot;, the power to synchronize with Time and Rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/d9252fa19daa2933b618e0f995c16873.avif?t=1787273693\" width=751 height=256 /></span>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By attacking and moving on the BEAT, you can charge up your cards, and activate them to deal great damage to the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has different abilities and attack patterns... Sync Yourself to the Music, and use them to your advantage to defeat the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick new cards as you encounter enemies during the battles, and equip yourself with Powerful Skills to Defeat them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also charge up your Ultimate Attack by synchronizing your action to the beat! Unleash it to deal great damage to the Enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/220717b8dc996eae776f0b8008282415.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/220717b8dc996eae776f0b8008282415.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/220717b8dc996eae776f0b8008282415.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Elements with Different Possibilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME is a Roguelike Deckbuilder that allows you to Replay the game more than one... if not many times! Expand your deck as you meet new enemies on the Procedurally Generated map, and create a unique deck every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/75e0a3c1646eee63d21a961f4524eb1e.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/75e0a3c1646eee63d21a961f4524eb1e.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/75e0a3c1646eee63d21a961f4524eb1e.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also equip powerful frequencies by levelling up, or by purchasing new upgrades from the shop! - Mix and match different frequencies and power ups to build your character each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/b734547d6731578cc4f105480b911de9.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/b734547d6731578cc4f105480b911de9.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/b734547d6731578cc4f105480b911de9.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/3b7f0dda5a0cbd087ba167580fedf236.avif?t=1787273693\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMITIME is a RHYTHM-based DECKBUILDER - where MUSIC is your STRATEGY!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combing multiple genres together, EMITIME creates a stylish and unique gameplay that makes you bop to the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your Attack and Movement to the RHYTHM on the Grid, and activate your SKILL CARDS to defeat the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck and customize your characters with frequencies (power ups!) during each run with various possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters from the Past... and Future...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the characters from the Past, or the Future - each of them is equipped with the power of &quot;EMITIME&quot;, the power to synchronize with Time and Rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/d9252fa19daa2933b618e0f995c16873.avif?t=1787273693\" width=751 height=256 /></span>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By attacking and moving on the BEAT, you can charge up your cards, and activate them to deal great damage to the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/2e95b815324ddc1abc4a1311dac4b206.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has different abilities and attack patterns... Sync Yourself to the Music, and use them to your advantage to defeat the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/08f4a8c9268379798ae2a81ff74fe7c4.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick new cards as you encounter enemies during the battles, and equip yourself with Powerful Skills to Defeat them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.webm?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/f8c690bfccfc20a6a68b8127137e8821.mp4?t=1787273693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also charge up your Ultimate Attack by synchronizing your action to the beat! Unleash it to deal great damage to the Enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/220717b8dc996eae776f0b8008282415.poster.avif?t=1787273693\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"http